        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Loom-width with a ground of cream silk, striped with alternate broad and narrow bands of deep and pale pink stripes. The edges and central band are overlaid with a brocaded pattern of white leaves and saffron yellow flowers.\nThe broad stripes are patterned with sheaves of roses, each bound with a tasselled lovers' knot in cerise. Branches of white blossom connect the pattern of sheaves."@en ;
